  "overstatement": "not_asked",
  "summary": "This is a carefully attributed research portfolio that moves from a calibration illustration to Iris’s evidence, working documents, and research record. Its greatest weakness is that the spatial storytelling ends early, leaving much of the page organized as conventional portfolio sections."
